f_FEM4_4.(2)=51.30
f_FEM4_4.(3)=114.84
f_FEM4_4.(4)=205.49
f_FEM16_4.(1)=17.90
f_FEM16_4.(2)=51.14
f_FEM16_4.(3)=113.83
f_FEM16_4.(4)=201.98
err_pct.(1)=0.00
err_pct.(2)=0.00
err_pct.(3)=0.00
err_pct.(4)=0.01
#show
$Table{modo_n; f_cont_4; f_FEM4_4; f_FEM16_4; err_pct @ "Modo"; "Continuo (Hz)"; "FEM N=4 (Hz)"; "FEM N=16 (Hz)"; "Error N=16 (%)" & fmt=2}

'Con N=4 el modo 1 ya converge al continuo, pero los modos altos (n=4) requieren N≥16 para precisión menor a 0.05 %.

